( Single control: record at 10, Bram's belief at 11.
  Separate state, but no memory-enforced boundary or internal message bus. )
|0100
;initial-belief LDA #11 STZ
;receive #d0 DEO2 #0800 #d2 DEO2 !record
@receive
#dd DEI #ff NEQ ?done
#d4 DEI #01 NEQ ?done
#0800 LDA #01 EQU ?record
#0800 LDA #02 EQU ?ask
#0800 LDA #03 EQU ?return
#0800 LDA #04 EQU ?share
BRK
@record
#10 LDZ ?returned-record
;record-kept !say
@returned-record ;record-returned !say
@return #01 #10 STZ !record
@ask
#11 LDZ ?returned-answer
;belief-kept !say
@returned-answer ;belief-returned !say
@share
#10 LDZ #11 STZ ;shared !say
@done BRK
